There are some good things you can do even as a were-rat.  Ever fight a
were-animal and have it summon several of it's animal-counterparts for
help ?  Well, you can do it too... try the #monster command to get any
creature's special ability.

Of course, being a were-something is a pain after a time, so getting
rid of it is nice.  I'm not sure of cure-sickness, but holy water does
the thing.
